msgid "Should point to the tenancy home region"
msgstr "应指向租户主页区域"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:69
msgid "Standalone"
msgstr "独立"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:64
msgid ""
"Standalone mode will use the built-in webserver of acme.sh to issue a "
"certificate. Webroot mode will use an existing webserver to issue a "
"certificate. DNS mode will allow you to use the DNS API of your DNS provider "
"to issue a certificate."
msgstr ""
"独立模式将使用 acme.sh 的内置 Web 服务器来颁发证书。Webroot 模式将使用现有的 "
"Web 服务器来颁发证书。DNS 模式将允许您使用 DNS 提供商的 DNS API 颁发证书。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:457
msgid ""
"The challenge alias to use for ALL domains. See %s for the details of this "
"process. LUCI only supports one challenge alias per certificate."
msgstr ""
"用于所有域的质询别名。有关此过程的详细信息，请参阅 %s。LUCI 仅支持每个证书一"
"个质询别名。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:447
msgid ""
"The credentials for the DNS API mode selected above. See %s for the format "
"of credentials required by each API. Add multiple entries here in KEY=VAL "
"shell variable format to supply multiple credential variables."
msgstr ""
"上面选择的 DNS API 模式的凭据。请参阅 %s 以了解每个 API 所需的凭据格式。在此"
"处以 KEY=VAL shell 变量格式添加多个条目以提供多个凭据变量。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:466
msgid ""
"The domain alias to use for ALL domains. See %s for the details of this "
"process. LUCI only supports one challenge domain per certificate."
msgstr ""
"用于所有域的域别名。有关此过程的详细信息，请参阅 %s。LUCI 仅支持每个证书一个"
"质询域名。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:383
msgid "The private API signing key in PEM format"
msgstr "PEM 格式的私有 API 签名密钥"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:26
msgid ""
"This configures ACME automatic certificate installation. Simply fill out "
"this to have the router configured with issued certificates for the web "
"interface. Note that the domain names in the certificate must already be "
"configured to point at the router's public IP address. Once configured, "
"issuing certificates can take a while. Check the logs for progress and any "
"errors."
msgstr ""
"这将配置 ACME 自动证书安装。只需填写此信息即可为路由器配置已颁发的 Web 界面证"
"书。请注意，证书中的域名必须已配置为指向路由器的公共 IP 地址。配置完成后，颁"
"发证书可能需要一段时间。检查日志以了解进度和任何错误。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:299
msgid "This is usually NOT an email address"
msgstr "这通常不是电子邮件地址"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:89
msgid ""
"To use DNS mode to issue certificates, set this to the name of a DNS API "
"supported by acme.sh. See %s for the list of available APIs. In DNS mode, "
"the domain name does not have to resolve to the router IP. DNS mode is also "
"the only mode that supports wildcard certificates. Using this mode requires "
"the acme-dnsapi package to be installed."
msgstr ""
"要使用 DNS 模式颁发证书，请将其设置为 acme.sh 支持的 DNS API 的名称。请参阅 "
"%s 以获取可用 API 的列表。在 DNS 模式下，域名不必解析为路由器 IP。DNS 模式也"
"是唯一支持通配符证书的模式。使用此模式需要安装 acme-dnsapi 包。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:492
msgid "Use a custom CA."
msgstr "使用自定义 CA。"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:500
msgid "Use staging server"
msgstr "使用临时服务器"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:63
msgid "Validation method"
msgstr "验证方式"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:474
msgid "Wait for DNS update"
msgstr "等待 DNS 更新"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:70
msgid "Webroot"
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:56
msgid "Webroot Challenge Validation"
msgstr "Webroot 挑战验证"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:78
msgid "Webroot directory"
msgstr "Webroot 目录"

#: applications/luci-app-acme/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/acme/acme.js:79
msgid ""
"Webserver root directory. Set this to the webserver document root to run "
"Acme in webroot mode. The web server must be accessible from the internet on "
"port 80."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务器根目录。将其设置为 Web 服务器文档根目录，以在 webroot 模式下运行 "
"Acme。Web 服务器必须可通过端口 80 从 Internet 访问。"
